{
  "id": 8867158393031,
  "title": "Christmas Bedding Quilt – Soft Microfiber Holiday Bedsprea - Design 09",
  "handle": "christmas-bedding-quilt-soft-microfiber-holiday-bedsprea-design-09",
  "body_html": "<p>Celebrate the holiday season with the Jeminise Christmas Bedding Quilt, designed to bring warmth and festive cheer to your home. This beautifully crafted quilt, made from premium microfiber, offers exceptional softness, breathability, and lasting comfort, making it a delightful addition to your bedroom or living space.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Festive Holiday Design:</strong> Features bright, high-quality Christmas prints that create a warm, joyful atmosphere and add a festive touch to any room.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Premium Comfort:</strong> Made from soft, lightweight microfiber, providing warmth in winter and coolness in warmer months for year-round versatility.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Thoughtful Gift:</strong> A cozy and meaningful present for loved ones during Christmas, New Year, birthdays, or other holiday celebrations.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable with cold water on a gentle cycle and tumble dry low or air dry, ensuring fade-resistant and wrinkle-free long-lasting softness.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Versatile Use:</strong> Perfect as a bedspread, a festive couch throw, or a warm companion for chilly nights and outdoor adventures.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Quilt Set</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Microfiber</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Christmas</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Design</th>\n<td>Christmas Quilt-ds07</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Included Components</th>\n<td>Quilt</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>Throw (60\"x70\"), Twin (68\"x86\"), Full (80\"x90\"), Queen (90\"x90\"), King (102\"x91\")</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine washable with cold water on gentle cycle. Tumble dry low or air dry.</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
